New YORK, Jan. 31—In the live stock market
to-day steers were in light supply and steady; bulls
and thin cows steady; medium cows slow; and
choice fat cows steady to firm. Steers, 50a;
goats and oxen, 150a; bulls, 40a; cows, 25a;
dressed beef slow all sales; calves
slow at 5c lower; veals 10.50; culls 50a;
barnyard calves, 50a; common Westerns, 42.

