 "Carpathia reached Titanic position at daybreak. Found boats and wreck age only. Titanic sank about 2:20 a, m. in 41:16 N. 50:14 w. All her boats accounted for, containing about e75 souls saved, crew and passengers included. Nearly all saved are women and children. Leyland liner Californ- ian remained and searched exact po- sition of disaster. Loss likely total ,S00 souls"

